---
---
<div class="calc" data-calc>
  <div class="calc-in">
    <label>
      <span>Prendas que entran al probador cada semana <output data-out="pruebas"></output></span>
      <input type="range" name="pruebas" min="50" max="2000" step="10" value="400" />
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>Cuántas se compran <output data-out="conversion"></output></span>
      <input type="range" name="conversion" min="5" max="60" step="1" value="25" />
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>Precio medio de la prenda <output data-out="precio"></output></span>
      <input type="range" name="precio" min="15" max="300" step="1" value="69" />
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="calc-out" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="calc-k">Probado y no vendido, esta semana</p>
    <p class="calc-big" data-out="semana">20.700 €</p>
    <p class="calc-sub"><span data-out="unidades">300</span> prendas. En una temporada de 26 semanas, <strong data-out="temporada">538.200 €</strong>.</p>
    <p class="small calc-foot">Con las cifras que elijas, no datos de ninguna marca. No todo se puede recuperar: Hebra te dice qué parte sí y qué hacer con ella.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .calc { display: grid; gap: 0; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--linea); }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .calc { grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; } }
  .calc-in { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); display: grid; gap: 2rem; }
  .calc-in label { display: grid; gap: .8rem; }
  .calc-in span { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .calc-in output { font-weight: 700; color: var(--blau); white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  input[type=range] { -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; width: 100%; height: 24px; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track { height: 2px; background: var(--pedra); }
  input[type=range]::-moz-range-track { height: 2px; background: var(--pedra); }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; width: 22px; height: 22px; margin-top: -10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blau); border: 3px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px var(--blau); }
  input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blau); border: 3px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px var(--blau); }
  .calc-out { background: var(--blau); color: var(--blanc); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .calc-k { margin: 0; color: #C9D3E0; }
  .calc-big { font: 340 clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 5.2rem)/1 var(--serif); font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144; margin: .4rem 0 1rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .calc-sub { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .calc-foot { color: #C9D3E0; margin: 0; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(249,249,249,.2); }
</style>
